---
import DirectoryLayout from "../layouts/DirectoryLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config/site";
---

<DirectoryLayout
  heading="Editorial & Data Policy"
  subheading="Our standards for data accuracy, zero hallucination, automated discovery, and corrections."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "All Jobs", item: "/jobs" },
    { name: "Editorial Policy", item: "/editorial-policy" },
  ]}
  canonicalPath="/editorial-policy"
  pageType="trust"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-sm sm:text-base font-medium text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
    <section class="neo-card p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3 bg-white">
      <div class="inline-block bg-[#FEF08A] px-2 py-0.5 border-2 border-black text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider shadow-[1.5px_1.5px_0px_0px_#000] mb-2">
        ZERO FABRICATION
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-black">1. Fact-First Data Standards</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>{siteConfig.name} operates under a strict Zero Hallucination policy:</strong>
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-700">
        <li>We never invent community names, invite links, founder names, or recruiter contacts.</li>
        <li>We never fabricate member counts, growth statistics, or user ratings.</li>
        <li>If a metadata attribute cannot be independently corroborated, it remains explicitly <code>null</code> or unlisted.</li>
        <li>We do not accept paid compensation for placement or artificial ranking boosts.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="neo-card p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3 bg-white">
      <div class="inline-block bg-[#A7F3D0] px-2 py-0.5 border-2 border-black text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider shadow-[1.5px_1.5px_0px_0px_#000] mb-2">
        AUTOMATION & AI BOUNDARIES
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-black">2. Automated Operations & Discovery</h2>
      <p>
        {siteConfig.name} uses automated search and validation systems to discover and monitor public job communities. Automated classifiers assist with assigning taxonomy tags, geographic entity verification, and link reachability checks.
      </p>
      <p>
        All automated candidate listings must pass strict programmatic gating (active status, geographic evidence, zero scam patterns) before entering public indexation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="neo-card p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-3 bg-white">
      <div class="inline-block bg-[#DDD6FE] px-2 py-0.5 border-2 border-black text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-wider shadow-[1.5px_1.5px_0px_0px_#000] mb-2">
        CORRECTIONS
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-black">3. Corrections & Takedown Protocol</h2>
      <p>
        If you are the administrator of a community and wish to update listing information, replace an invite URL, or request immediate removal, use our <a href="/report" class="font-black text-black underline hover:text-emerald-700">Report & Removal Desk</a>. Takedown requests are processed immediately.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</DirectoryLayout>
